Package: reactoros-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PB-Kronos <noreply@github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-tk, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gnome-menus, gnome-session, gnome-shell, gnome-control-center, dconf-cli, gnome-shell-extension-apps-menu, gnome-shell-extension-dash-to-panel, gnome-shell-extension-user-theme
Recommends: accountsservice, dbus-user-session, network-manager, network-manager-gnome, wpasupplicant, pipewire-audio, pipewire-alsa, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, alsa-utils, pulseaudio-utils, pavucontrol, firefox-esr, thunar, mousepad, ristretto, xterm, gparted, lxpolkit, arandr
Description: Windows 95-style ReactorOS desktop session for Debian
 A selectable desktop session and local workstation applications for Debian.
 ReactorOS runs alongside existing GNOME, KDE Plasma, and other desktop
 sessions. It does not replace the display manager or change the default
 desktop session.
